Package: secret-broker
Architecture: amd64 arm64 armhf
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, nodejs (>= 20)
Description: mTLS credential proxy for AI clients (CLI + server)
 Secret Broker is an mTLS credential proxy for AI clients (Mavis, Claude,
 Codex, etc.). It holds your service secrets (GitHub, OpenAI, AWS, Aliyun,
 ...) and injects them into API calls made by AI agents, so the AI never
 sees plaintext credentials.
 .
 This package installs:
   * secret-broker         — zero-dep Node CLI (health, list, get, proxy, exec, pki)
   * secret-broker-server  — Node broker server (needs PKI, config, and secrets)
 .
 Authentication factors: mTLS client cert (recommended), password, TOTP,
 WebAuthn, SMS, or recovery code.
 .
 Backward-compatible V4.0.x and V3.x → V4.1.0/V4.1.1 in-place upgrade
 supported via `migrate-v3-to-v4.sh` (not included in this package —
 see broker repo's scripts/broker/ for the upgrade tool).
